    <h2>Steam Clean Verdict</h2>

    <p>
        ✅ RECOMMENDED
    </p>

    <p>
        Rock of Ages 3 delivers a wonderfully strange combination of chaotic boulder physics, demanding tactical levels and completely unrestrained historical silliness. The repetition and occasional progression wall held it back slightly, but its personality, challenge and epic presentation made it an experience I absolutely loved.
